### Rename a chat (ChatController)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/rest/v1/ai-orchestrator/chat/name?conversationId={{conversationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newName": "Dependency injection basics"
}

### Alternate: call the ai-orchestrator service directly, bypassing the gateway
# POST {{aiOrchestratorUrl}}/rest/v1/chat/name?conversationId={{conversationId}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "newName": "Dependency injection basics"
# }
